' Cross-Layer Relationships
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

UcpM --> IORImpl : ISR: detects "ior:" strings\nin model properties,\ncreates IOR objects
JSI ..> TD : type field
TR --> TD : manages registry of

note right of UcpM
  **ISR (IOR Self-Replacement)**
  Proxy getter intercepts model property access.
  If value is string starting with "ior:":
  1. Creates IOR().initRemote(value) synchronously
  2. Replaces string with IOR object in model
  3. Fires resolveAndReplace() async (no await)
  4. Next access returns resolved object

  Also handles arrays of IOR strings (ISR.3)
end note

note bottom of IORImpl
  **Pluggable Loader Registry**
  Built-in: FileLoader (file:, fs:)
  Runtime-registered (by @web4x/once):
    HTTPSLoader (https:, http:)
    ScenarioLoader (scenario:)
    WebSocketLoader (wss:, ws:)
end note

note right of TR
  **Singleton Pattern**
  TypeRegistry.instance (lazy)
  Used by UcpComponent.start()
  to register class metadata
end note

